  "challenge": "This packet is decidable as REJECT without a human. AR-004 is a hard, unexplained $50 overcharge: stated total $22,562.80 vs subtotal+tax $22,512.80 with no additional_charges or notes covering the gap—validators already proved the mismatch, so there is nothing for an approver to \"confirm.\" PO-001 only gates auto-approval above $10k; it does not require escalation when the correct action is to refuse payment until a corrected invoice arrives. IN-003 is an operational stock/backorder signal (policy even notes every per-line check passes), not a legitimacy defect—the multi-lot notes (Volume discount, Replacement, Sample, Expedited) already show intentional aggregate qty, and item refs match the non-discount unit prices ($250/$500/$750). Vendor is active since 2019 with matching Net 60, get_prior_invoice found no INV-1013, and DP-001 is informational. Reject for the $50 billing error; vendor resubmits.",
  "proposed_outcome": "REJECT",
  "cites_finding_codes": ["AR-004", "PO-001", "IN-003"]
}
